一緒(いっしょ)に + Vましょう = ayo lakukan... bersama
一緒(いっしょ)に = bersama

446
00:29:07,953 --> 00:29:11,553
Tes Mendengarkan

447
00:29:11,553 --> 00:29:15,819
Mendengar suara Tanaka-san.

448
00:29:15,819 --> 00:29:21,653
Nを + 聞(き)きました = mendengar N
声(こえ) = suara
聞(き)く = mendengar

449
00:29:21,676 --> 00:29:26,212
Tes Mendengarkan

450
00:29:26,212 --> 00:29:31,645
Rasa sepi sedikit berkurang.

451
00:29:31,645 --> 00:29:39,019
Nが + Vました = N hilang/lenyap
気持(きも)ち = perasaan
消(き)える = menghilang

452
00:29:39,042 --> 00:29:42,520
Tes Mendengarkan

453
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:46,596
Aku tidak sendirian.

454
